  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Research</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TMA&apos;s Research and Learning Programme is designed to strengthen the organization&apos;s evidence base, inform strategic decision-making, and enhance programme design and delivery. Through targeted research initiatives, knowledge generation, and learning activities, the programme supports continuous improvement, innovation, and adaptive management across TMA&apos;s operations. It also promotes the use of data-driven insights to shape policy engagement, monitor emerging trends, and demonstrate impact, ensuring that TMA&apos;s interventions remain relevant, effective, and responsive to dynamic trade and development landscapes.</narrative>
  </description>
